_runner.py,venv/Lib/site-packages/langsmith/evaluation/_runner.py,e755fe42301872089b10aa08932d688624a822b1,amymariam/Multilanguage-invoice,https://api.github.com/repositories/916861238/contents/venv/Lib/site-packages/langsmith/evaluation/_runner.py?ref=cd8030e31db95745b761db6003b2d6366bc26ab0,https://api.github.com/repositories/916861238/git/blobs/e755fe42301872089b10aa08932d688624a822b1,https://github.com/amymariam/Multilanguage-invoice/blob/cd8030e31db95745b761db6003b2d6366bc26ab0/venv/Lib/site-packages/langsmith/evaluation/_runner.py,,,0,0,0,1,2025-01-14T23:00:17Z,0,0,"# MultiLanguage Invoice Extractor

This project is a web application that allows users to upload an image of an invoice and extract information from it using Google's Generative AI model `gemini-1.5-flash`. The application is built with Streamlit for the web interface.

## Features

- Upload an image of an invoice in JPG, JPEG, or PNG format.
- Input a text prompt to guide the extraction process.
- Display the uploaded image.
- Extract and display information from the image based on the input prompt.

## Requirements

- Python 3.9 or higher
- Streamlit
- Pillow (PIL)
- python-dotenv
- google-generativeai


