manager.py,venv/Lib/site-packages/langchain_core/callbacks/manager.py,f675b230c879bf31ee3fd318133086601f0084e3,goldersayantan/SmartPDF-Chatbot,https://api.github.com/repositories/937443554/contents/venv/Lib/site-packages/langchain_core/callbacks/manager.py?ref=f1c7a33263797341e0288ff173220f28ea5e8985,https://api.github.com/repositories/937443554/git/blobs/f675b230c879bf31ee3fd318133086601f0084e3,https://github.com/goldersayantan/SmartPDF-Chatbot/blob/f1c7a33263797341e0288ff173220f28ea5e8985/venv/Lib/site-packages/langchain_core/callbacks/manager.py,"SmartPDF Chatbot is a Streamlit-based AI app that allows users to upload PDF files and interact with the content using natural language. It leverages large language models (LLMs) to answer questions, summarize content, and enhance document understanding through a simple chat interface.",,0,0,0,16,2025-06-15T19:50:58Z,1,0,"# 🤖 Smart PDF Chatbot

**Smart PDF Chatbot** is an intelligent web application that allows users to **upload PDF files** and **interact with the content** using natural language questions. It leverages **LLMs**, **RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation)**, and **Streamlit** to make document comprehension seamless and conversational.

🔗 **Live Demo:** [smartpdf-chatbot.streamlit.app](https://smartpdf-chatbot.streamlit.app/)

---

## 🧠 Features

- 📄 Upload any PDF document
- 💬 Ask questions in natural language
- ⚡ Fast and intelligent responses using LLMs
- 📚 Powered by Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG)
- 🧼 Clean and user-friendly Streamlit interface

---

## 🛠️ Built With

- **Python 3**
- **Streamlit** – UI Framework
- **Langchain / Gemini API** – LLM integration
- **PyMuPDF / pdfplumber** – PDF parsing
- **FAISS / Chroma** – Vector store for semantic search
- **OpenAI / Gemini / LlamaIndex** – Language Model (depending on your setup)

--

## 🧪 Example Use Cases
- Understand research papers by querying them
- Ask questions from textbooks or study material
- Explore product manuals and legal documents
- Customer support with PDF-based knowledge base

--

