   ```
2. Navigate to the project directory:
   ```bash
   cd AI-Powered-_Mental_Health-_Support_Project
   ```
3. Install dependencies:
   ```bash
   npm install
   ```
4. Start the server:
   ```bash
   npm start
   ```

