### Environment Configuration
```bash
# Production environment variables
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:pass@prod-server:5432/knowledge_base
GOOGLE_API_KEY=your_production_gemini_key
DEBUG=False
HOST=0.0.0.0
PORT=8000

