> Advanced AI-powered website generation through sophisticated multi-agent coordination

![Python](https://img.shields.io/badge/Python-3.10-blue.svg)
![AI](https://img.shields.io/badge/AI-Multi--Agent-yellow.svg)
![Streamlit](https://img.shields.io/badge/Streamlit-Deployed-green.svg)
![Status](https://img.shields.io/badge/Status-Production%20Ready-green.svg)

## 🚀 Live Demo

**🌐 Try WebWeaver Enterprise Live**: **[https://webweaver.streamlit.app/](https://webweaver.streamlit.app/)**

*Experience the future of AI-powered web development - build professional websites through natural language conversations with our 6-agent AI system.*

---

## 📋 Project Overview

**WebWeaver** is a comprehensive exploration of multi-agent AI systems for web development, showcasing three distinct approaches to AI-powered website generation. From advanced research implementations to production-ready enterprise solutions, this project demonstrates the evolution of AI agents working collaboratively to create professional websites.

## 🎯 Three-Phase Evolution

### 🚀 **Phase 3: WebWeaver Enterprise** ⭐ *Production Ready*
**Location**: `phase3_live_web_studio/` | **Live Demo**: [webweaver.streamlit.app](https://webweaver.streamlit.app/)

**The Enterprise Solution** - A sophisticated 6-agent AI system delivering Fortune 500-quality websites through natural language interactions.

#### Key Features
- **🤖 6 Specialized AI Agents**: ProductManager, Design, Content, HTML, QA, and Package agents
- **🧠 Individual Agent Memory**: Each agent learns and remembers context across sessions
- **⚡ Surgical Editing**: Precise modifications without breaking existing functionality
- **🎨 Professional Design**: AI-generated design systems with modern aesthetics
- **✍️ Expert Copywriting**: Industry-specific, conversion-focused content
- **🔍 Quality Assurance**: Automated testing and optimization
- **📱 Single-File Output**: Complete responsive websites in one HTML file
- **🔧 Live Development**: Real-time preview with instant modifications

#### Technology Stack
- **AI Engine**: OpenAI GPT-4o (latest model)
- **Framework**: Streamlit with enterprise-grade UI
- **Architecture**: Multi-agent coordination with memory systems
- **Deployment**: Production-ready with Streamlit Cloud

#### Agent Workflow
```
User Input → ProductManager → DesignAgent → ContentAgent → HTMLAgent ↔ QAAgent → Enterprise Website
```

---

### 🏗️ **Phase 2: Multi-Agent Website Builder**
**Location**: `phase2_multiagent_website_builder/`

**The Specialist System** - Multi-model AI approach with task-specific optimization using GPT-4o and GPT-4.

#### Key Features
- **🎯 Task-Specialized Agents**: 6 agents optimized for specific development tasks
- **🤖 Multi-Model Strategy**: GPT-4o for complex tasks, GPT-4 for core logic
- **⚡ Performance Optimized**: Strategic model selection for optimal results
- **🏗️ Professional Output**: Production-quality website generation

#### Agent Specialization
- **WebCodeAgent** (GPT-4o): Full-stack development
- **UIDesignAgent** (GPT-4o): Interface design and UX
- **RequirementsAgent** (GPT-4o): Specification analysis
- **JSAgent, HTMLAgent, CSSAgent** (GPT-4o): Technology-specific development
- **Core Management** (GPT-4): Application coordination

---

### 🧠 **Phase 1: Advanced Multi-Agent System**
**Location**: `phase1_multiagent_django_streamlit/`

**The Research Platform** - Comprehensive AI development pipeline with 10+ agents powered by Google Gemini.

#### Key Features
- **🔬 Research-Grade**: Advanced AI coordination and workflow management
- **🤖 Google Gemini Powered**: Single advanced model with multiple configurations
- **📊 Comprehensive Agents**: 10+ specialized agents for complete development lifecycle
- **🏢 Enterprise Applications**: Full Django + Streamlit application generation

#### Advanced Capabilities
- Complex multi-agent orchestration
- Advanced LLM integration patterns
- Sophisticated workflow management
- Complete application generation

---

## 🎯 Usage & Access

### 🌐 **Instant Access (Recommended)**
Visit **[https://webweaver.streamlit.app/](https://webweaver.streamlit.app/)** for immediate access to WebWeaver Enterprise.

No installation required - experience the full power of our 6-agent AI system instantly!

### 🛠️ **Local Development**

#### Phase 3 - WebWeaver Enterprise
```bash
cd phase3_live_web_studio
pip install -r requirements.txt
echo ""OPENAI_API_KEY=your_key_here"" > .env
python run.py
```

#### Phase 2 - Multi-Agent Website Builder
```bash
cd phase2_multiagent_website_builder
pip install -r requirements.txt
echo ""OPENAI_API_KEY=your_key_here"" > .env
streamlit run multiagent_website_builder.py
```

#### Phase 1 - Advanced Multi-Agent System
```bash
cd phase1_multiagent_django_streamlit
pip install -r requirements.txt
echo ""GEMINI_API_KEY=your_key_here"" > .env
streamlit run multiagent_django_streamlit.py
```

---

## 🤖 AI Architecture Comparison

| Aspect | Phase 1 | Phase 2 | Phase 3 |
|--------|---------|---------|---------|
| **AI Model** | Google Gemini 2.0 Flash | GPT-4o + GPT-4 | OpenAI GPT-4o |
| **Strategy** | Single model, multiple configs | Multi-model specialization | Enterprise coordination |
| **Agent Count** | 10+ research agents | 6 specialized agents | 6 enterprise agents |
| **Memory System** | Basic workflow | Task-specific | Individual agent memory |
| **Target Use** | Research & exploration | Development optimization | Production deployment |
| **Complexity** | High (research-grade) | Medium (developer-focused) | Streamlined (user-focused) |
| **Output Quality** | Comprehensive | Optimized | Enterprise-grade |

---

## 📈 Key Innovations

### 🧠 **Agent Memory Systems**
Each phase demonstrates different approaches to AI agent memory and coordination:
- **Phase 1**: Workflow-based memory for research applications
- **Phase 2**: Task-specific memory for optimized development
- **Phase 3**: Individual agent memory for personalized experiences

### ⚡ **Surgical Editing Technology**
Progressive development of precise modification capabilities:
- **Phase 1**: Basic modification patterns
- **Phase 2**: Task-specific editing strategies  
- **Phase 3**: Surgical editing that preserves functionality

### 🎨 **Design Intelligence Evolution**
From basic templates to AI-driven design systems:
- **Phase 1**: Template-based generation
- **Phase 2**: Model-optimized design decisions
- **Phase 3**: Comprehensive AI design systems with professional aesthetics

---

## 🏆 Success Metrics

### Phase 3 (Production)
- ✅ **Live Deployment**: Publicly accessible at webweaver.streamlit.app
- ✅ **Enterprise Quality**: Fortune 500-grade output
- ✅ **User Experience**: Intuitive natural language interface
- ✅ **Performance**: 30-60 second website generation
- ✅ **Memory System**: Context-aware agent interactions

### Phase 2 (Development)
- ✅ **Multi-Model Coordination**: Optimal AI model selection
- ✅ **Task Specialization**: 6 specialized development agents
- ✅ **Performance Optimization**: Strategic model deployment
- ✅ **Professional Output**: Production-quality websites

