_runner.py,venv/Lib/site-packages/langsmith/evaluation/_runner.py,d6f1c24c1006ea77f72b04774266baf7e74a83c3,CornsoupProjectTeam/Prompt-Microservice,https://api.github.com/repositories/956407644/contents/venv/Lib/site-packages/langsmith/evaluation/_runner.py?ref=b9b7a986a438ff5e8e104b5bbed94767d2c91fc9,https://api.github.com/repositories/956407644/git/blobs/d6f1c24c1006ea77f72b04774266baf7e74a83c3,https://github.com/CornsoupProjectTeam/Prompt-Microservice/blob/b9b7a986a438ff5e8e104b5bbed94767d2c91fc9/venv/Lib/site-packages/langsmith/evaluation/_runner.py,"이 프로젝트는 한국어 특화 Gemma2 모델을 활용해 Big5 성향을 유도하도록 정의된 프롬프트를 기반으로, 사용자와의 실시간 대화를 Kafka를 통해 전송하는 Prompt 마이크로서비스입니다.",,0,0,0,68,2025-08-12T05:44:27Z,0,0,"# Prompt-Microservice


이 프로젝트는 한국어 특화 Gemma2 모델을 활용해 Big5 성향을 유도하도록 정의된 프롬프트를 기반으로 사용자와의 실시간 대화를 Kafka를 통해 전송하는 Prompt 마이크로서비스입니다.

- LangChain + Ollama 기반 LLM 응답 생성
- Kafka 메시지 기반 비동기 성향 분석
- 3단계 체인 구조: 주감지 체인 / 감시 체인 / 보조 체인
- 성향 수집이 부족할 경우 보완 질문 또는 직접 설문 질문 수행

---

## 시스템 구조

```mermaid
graph TD
    U[사용자 입력 (chat_input)] -->|Kafka| C[ChatConsumer (주감지 체인)]
    C -->|LLM 응답 생성| O[chat_output]
    C -->|응답 기록| R[RAG 시스템 (성향 분석)]
    R -->|Kafka big5_scores| M[MonitorService (감시 체인)]
    M -->|누락 성향 확인| B[AuxiliaryPromptService (보조 체인)]
    B -->|보완/직접 질문| C
    M -->|5성향 수집 시| DONE[chat_done]"
_runner.py,venv/Lib/site-packages/langsmith/evaluation/_runner.py,d6f1c24c1006ea77f72b04774266baf7e74a83c3,mrGupta04/Calander-Assistant,https://api.github.com/repositories/1009662461/contents/venv/Lib/site-packages/langsmith/evaluation/_runner.py?ref=01a774e26e1a9dbbb0ff5335905208da12b9d75f,https://api.github.com/repositories/1009662461/git/blobs/d6f1c24c1006ea77f72b04774266baf7e74a83c3,https://github.com/mrGupta04/Calander-Assistant/blob/01a774e26e1a9dbbb0ff5335905208da12b9d75f/venv/Lib/site-packages/langsmith/evaluation/_runner.py,,,0,0,0,8,2025-07-05T12:45:19Z,0,0,"# 🗓️ Conversational Calendar Booking Assistant

This project is a conversational AI agent that helps users **book appointments on their Google Calendar** through a natural, interactive chat interface. Built with **FastAPI**, **LangGraph**, and **Streamlit**, this assistant understands user intent, checks availability, suggests time slots, and confirms meetings — all in one seamless flow.

🚀 **Live Demo**: [Click to try the app](https://mrgupta04-calander-assistant-streamlit-app-fva5e5.streamlit.app/)

---

## 🔧 Tech Stack

- **Backend**: Python with [FastAPI](https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/)
- **Agent Framework**: [LangGraph](https://www.langgraph.dev/)
- **Frontend**: [Streamlit](https://streamlit.io/) for the chat interface
- **Calendar Integration**: Google Calendar API

---

## 💡 Features

- Accepts user input in **natural language**
- Guides conversations toward **booking an appointment**
- **Checks real-time availability** from Google Calendar
- **Books and confirms** time slots instantly
- Handles **ambiguous or vague queries** with follow-up questions

---

## 💬 Example Conversations

- “Hey, I want to schedule a call for tomorrow afternoon.”
- “Do you have any free time this Friday?”
- “Book a meeting between 3–5 PM next week.”
- “Can we schedule something early next week?”
- “I’m only free after 4 PM tomorrow.”

---

## 🧠 How It Works

1. **Streamlit Interface**: Users interact with the AI assistant through a simple and friendly chat UI.
2. **LangGraph Agent**: Interprets intent and manages the dialog flow.
3. **FastAPI Backend**: Handles API requests and integrates with Google Calendar.
4. **Calendar Integration**: Verifies availability and books events in real-time.

📎 Live Submission

🟢 Test the Assistant Live:
https://mrgupta04-calander-assistant-streamlit-app-fva5e5.streamlit.app/
