#### 4. Configure Ingress

```yaml
# kube-vm/ingress.yaml
apiVersion: networking.k8s.io/v1
kind: Ingress
metadata:
  name: chatbot-ingress
  namespace: dn-academy-chatbot
  annotations:
    nginx.ingress.kubernetes.io/rewrite-target: /
    nginx.ingress.kubernetes.io/ssl-redirect: ""true""
