manager.py,venv/Lib/site-packages/langchain_core/callbacks/manager.py,3b4f1f6e30e69a9c84809ed8890fd86788f25226,maithilimukherjee/my-first-ai-agent,https://api.github.com/repositories/1024452328/contents/venv/Lib/site-packages/langchain_core/callbacks/manager.py?ref=d7f2a301ff94f5e3336a220ebbc575f6cfb43f5d,https://api.github.com/repositories/1024452328/git/blobs/3b4f1f6e30e69a9c84809ed8890fd86788f25226,https://github.com/maithilimukherjee/my-first-ai-agent/blob/d7f2a301ff94f5e3336a220ebbc575f6cfb43f5d/venv/Lib/site-packages/langchain_core/callbacks/manager.py,i built my first ai agent using together ai api key! ,,0,0,0,2,2025-07-22T18:19:00Z,0,0,"## ai agent demo 
this is a simple ai chatbot project built using the together python sdk and the meta-llama-3.1-8b-instruct-turbo model. it streams responses from the together.ai api and prints them in real time, acting as a lightweight terminal-based agent.

the goal of this project is to help me understand how api calls, streaming responses, and environment variables work in practice. it's a demo for learning, experimenting, and having fun with ai."
manager.py,venv/Lib/site-packages/langchain_core/callbacks/manager.py,3b4f1f6e30e69a9c84809ed8890fd86788f25226,priyankaezhil/Agent_AI,https://api.github.com/repositories/1024873993/contents/venv/Lib/site-packages/langchain_core/callbacks/manager.py?ref=01f63aaa4085700041f1010899a4f5b1eff15670,https://api.github.com/repositories/1024873993/git/blobs/3b4f1f6e30e69a9c84809ed8890fd86788f25226,https://github.com/priyankaezhil/Agent_AI/blob/01f63aaa4085700041f1010899a4f5b1eff15670/venv/Lib/site-packages/langchain_core/callbacks/manager.py,,,0,0,0,8,2025-07-24T15:04:25Z,0,0,"<h1>Agent AI — E-commerce Data Question Answering System</h1>

<h2>Overview:<h2></h2>

Agent AI is an intelligent agent built to answer natural language questions about an e-commerce dataset. By combining the power of LLMs (like LLaMA 3) with SQL and FastAPI, this system transforms structured data into conversational insights. This project is ideal for teams that want to explore how AI can interface with real-time data without building full dashboards or writing SQL manually.

<h2>Key Features:</h2>

- Ask questions in plain English (e.g., ""Which product had the highest total sales?"")
- Works with real e-commerce datasets (sales, ads, eligibility)
- Powered by LLaMA 3 via Ollama and a local SQLite database
- Automatically converts natural language into SQL queries
- Local execution — no need for cloud APIs
- Built with FastAPI for fast and flexible backend routing
- Easily extendable with additional endpoints or streaming LLMs

