_runner.py,venv/Lib/site-packages/langsmith/evaluation/_runner.py,8ca94680a0fb6d2459a96fbeda0605f36b4b5dc3,Baisampayan1324/MCP-testing,https://api.github.com/repositories/1045207057/contents/venv/Lib/site-packages/langsmith/evaluation/_runner.py?ref=1dfd86828fe2fdf549dafffedb2715383198c434,https://api.github.com/repositories/1045207057/git/blobs/8ca94680a0fb6d2459a96fbeda0605f36b4b5dc3,https://github.com/Baisampayan1324/MCP-testing/blob/1dfd86828fe2fdf549dafffedb2715383198c434/venv/Lib/site-packages/langsmith/evaluation/_runner.py,,,0,0,0,16,2025-08-27T17:48:06Z,0,0,"# 📚 Research Paper Summarization System

A complete RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation) system for research paper summarization with modular architecture and cloud deployment support.

## 🚀 Quick Start

1. **Install dependencies:**
   ```bash
