| Variable | Description | Required | Default |
|----------|-------------|----------|---------|
| `JWT_SECRET` | JWT signing secret (32 chars) | Yes | - |
| `ENCRYPTION_KEY` | Data encryption key (32 chars) | Yes | - |
| `SESSION_SECRET` | Session signing secret (32 chars) | Yes | - |
