## Overview
HunterOS is a multi-agent AI system designed to help organize and optimize your daily life. Built with CrewAI, it orchestrates specialized agents for fitness, scheduling, email management, nutrition, learning, and habit tracking.

## 🏗 Architecture

### Core Technologies
- **Agent Framework**: CrewAI + LangChain
- **LLMs**: Claude 3.5 Sonnet / GPT-4 / GPT-4o-mini / Ollama (local)
- **Backend**: Python FastAPI + Celery
- **Frontend**: Flutter + Riverpod + Drift
- **Databases**: 
  - PostgreSQL/Supabase (structured data + pgvector)
  - Redis (caching & queues)
  - Drift (offline-first mobile)
- **Security**: Fernet encryption + HashiCorp Vault
- **Monitoring**: Prometheus + Grafana + Sentry

## 🤖 Agent Roster

### Core Agents
1. **Life Coordinator** - Orchestrates all other agents
2. **Fitness Coach** - Workout planning and tracking
3. **Schedule Manager** - Calendar optimization
4. **Inbox Assistant** - Email triage and responses
5. **Nutrition Planner** - Meal planning and groceries
6. **Learning Curator** - Reading and knowledge management
7. **Habit Tracker** - Behavior change and streaks

## 🚦 Quick Start

### Prerequisites
- Python 3.11+
- Node.js 18+
- Flutter 3.0+
- Docker & Docker Compose
- Supabase account

### Local Development Setup

```bash
# 1. Clone the repository
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/hunterOS.git
cd hunterOS

# 2. Setup Python backend
cd backend
python -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate  # On Windows: venv\Scripts\activate
pip install -r requirements.txt

# 3. Configure environment
cp .env.example .env
# Edit .env with your API keys

# 4. Start services with Docker
docker-compose up -d

# 5. Initialize database
python scripts/init_db.py

# 6. Run backend
uvicorn api.main:app --reload

# 7. Setup Flutter app (new terminal)
cd ../mobile
flutter pub get
flutter run
```

## 📁 Project Structure

```
hunterOS/
├── backend/              # Python backend with CrewAI
│   ├── agents/          # Individual agent implementations
│   ├── crews/           # Crew configurations
│   ├── tools/           # LangChain tools & registry
│   ├── api/             # FastAPI endpoints
│   ├── memory/          # Memory management system
│   ├── feedback/        # User feedback loop
│   ├── security/        # Encryption & RBAC
│   └── monitoring/      # Metrics & observability
├── mobile/              # Flutter mobile app
│   ├── lib/
│   │   ├── services/    # API & sync services
│   │   ├── widgets/     # UI components
│   │   ├── database/    # Drift local DB
│   │   └── security/    # Local encryption
│   └── assets/
├── infrastructure/      # Deployment configs
│   ├── docker/         # Container definitions
│   ├── kubernetes/     # K8s manifests
│   └── terraform/      # Infrastructure as code
├── docs/               # Documentation
└── tests/              # Test suites
```

## 🔑 Key Features

### Intelligent Planning
- AI-powered daily planning with context awareness
- Adaptive workout suggestions based on readiness
- Smart email triage and task extraction

### Privacy & Security
- End-to-end encryption for sensitive data
- Local processing option with Ollama
- Role-based access control (RBAC)
- Automatic key rotation via HashiCorp Vault

### Offline-First
- Full offline functionality with Drift
- Smart conflict resolution during sync
- Cached plans with expiration management

### Continuous Learning
- User feedback loop with confidence weighting
- Memory compression and archival
- Preference evolution tracking

