Store your Telgram Bot Token and GEMINI API key in .env file
```ini
GEMINI_API_KEY=sk-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=xxxxxxxxxx:xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
```

