#### macOS (CPU/M1/M2) with full document Q/A capability
* One-click Installers (Experimental and subject to changes)

  Nov 08, 2023
  - [h2ogpt-osx-m1-cpu](https://h2o-release.s3.amazonaws.com/h2ogpt/Nov2023/h2ogpt-osx-m1-cpu)
