app.py,app.py,b8aa5db21beec1f566c06793d8e905ad21913186,alexolivet/AI-Project,https://api.github.com/repositories/626943475/contents/app.py?ref=8a7f7ea79c55ce322ba95236db216fe18dcc3fa4,https://api.github.com/repositories/626943475/git/blobs/b8aa5db21beec1f566c06793d8e905ad21913186,https://github.com/alexolivet/AI-Project/blob/8a7f7ea79c55ce322ba95236db216fe18dcc3fa4/app.py,creating a robot that could help me learn the fun way,,0,0,0,14,2024-09-21T15:23:51Z,0,0,"# **Alex's AI Project**

## **Introduction**

This is Alex's AI Project. It is a tool designed to make using Artificial Intelligence (AI) more accessible and user-friendly.

The main goal of the project is to provide users with an intuitive interface that allows them to interact with AI systems in a more natural way, while also providing essential information about how these systems work.

## **Key Features**

### **Natural Language Processing (NLP)**

One of the key features of this project is its NLP capabilities. This includes language recognition and understanding, as well as machine learning algorithms that enable it to generate responses based on natural language input.

The system also offers a range of pre-built chatbots and voice assistants that are available for purchase or download, allowing users to interact with their AI systems in a more human-like way.

### **AI Learning**

The AI in this project is designed to learn from its interactions with users. This means that the more you use it, the better it gets at understanding your needs and providing relevant information.

To help with learning, the system provides feedback on your inputs and outputs, allowing it to improve over time. It also allows users to set up custom training sessions to personalize their experience.

## **tips**

**Train your system**: To get the most out of your AI Project, it's essential to train your system. This involves providing feedback on its responses and allowing it to learn from your inputs and outputs.
**Share with others**: Finally, share your experience with others by posting about your project on social media or in relevant online forums."
gpt_langchain.py,src/gpt_langchain.py,6dbaaea4e1f1e62cf53ca18f83d4e7a420d3444e,achyuth4/OpenGPT-v1,https://api.github.com/repositories/664229037/contents/src/gpt_langchain.py?ref=805d5a7967059c4d0ec7b15cf0873b2591c29145,https://api.github.com/repositories/664229037/git/blobs/6dbaaea4e1f1e62cf53ca18f83d4e7a420d3444e,https://github.com/achyuth4/OpenGPT-v1/blob/805d5a7967059c4d0ec7b15cf0873b2591c29145/src/gpt_langchain.py,,,0,0,0,2316,2023-07-15T05:07:36Z,1,0,"## AchyuthGPT

Turn ★ into ⭐ (top-right corner) if you like the project!

- [![img-small.png](docs/img-small.png) Live AchyuthGPT Document Q/A Demo](https://gpt.AchyuthGPT.ai/)
- [🤗 Live AchyuthGPT Chat Demo 1](https://huggingface.co/spaces/AchyuthGPTai/AchyuthGPT-chatbot)
- [🤗 Live AchyuthGPT Chat Demo 2](https://huggingface.co/spaces/AchyuthGPTai/AchyuthGPT-chatbot2)

Watch these YouTube Videos:
- [100% Offline ChatGPT Alternative?](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Coj72EzmX20)
- [Ultimate Open-Source LLM Showdown (6 Models Tested) - Surprising Results!](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FTm5C_vV_EY)
- [Blazing Fast Falcon 40b 🚀 Uncensored, Open-Source, Fully Hosted, Chat With Your Docs](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=H8Dx-iUY49s)

For questions, discussing, or just hanging out, come and join our <a href=""https://discord.gg/WKhYMWcVbq""><b>Discord</b></a>!

Technical Paper: [https://arxiv.org/pdf/2306.08161.pdf](https://arxiv.org/pdf/2306.08161.pdf)

AchyuthGPT is a large language model (LLM) fine-tuning framework and chatbot UI with document(s) question-answer capabilities.  Documents help to **ground** LLMs against hallucinations by providing them context relevant to the instruction.  AchyuthGPT is fully permissive Apache V2 open-source project for 100% private and secure use of LLMs and document embeddings for document question-answer.

Welcome!  Join us and make an issue or a PR, and contribute to making the best fine-tuned LLMs, chatbot UI, and document question-answer framework!

