rag_service.py,app/services/rag_service.py,fef085b60a017097670c0ac910e6e268875103c4,chiillbro/documentor-backend-hf,https://api.github.com/repositories/983679397/contents/app/services/rag_service.py?ref=babdc60a5114c12487a01a080ab31e784dbbf621,https://api.github.com/repositories/983679397/git/blobs/fef085b60a017097670c0ac910e6e268875103c4,https://github.com/chiillbro/documentor-backend-hf/blob/babdc60a5114c12487a01a080ab31e784dbbf621/app/services/rag_service.py,,,0,0,0,1,2025-05-14T18:51:23Z,0,0,"# DocuMentor AI - Backend Service

FastAPI backend for DocuMentor, providing PDF processing, RAG pipeline, and LLM interaction via Ollama.

**Features:**

- PDF Upload & Text Extraction
- Text Chunking & Embedding
- Vector Storage with PostgreSQL/pgvector (external DB)
- RAG Q&A with local LLMs (e.g., TinyLlama) via Ollama
- Streaming API for LLM responses

**Deployment:**
This repository is intended for deployment on platforms like Hugging Face Spaces using Docker.

**Environment Variables Required at Runtime:**

- `DATABASE_URL`: Connection string for PostgreSQL (e.g., Neon.tech)
- `OLLAMA_MODEL_NAME`: (e.g., `tinyllama`) - Note: Model is baked into the Docker image.
- `EMBEDDING_MODEL_NAME`: (e.g., `sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2`)
- `LLM_PROVIDER`: Should be `ollama`
- `OLLAMA_BASE_URL`: Should be `http://localhost:11434` (as Ollama runs in same container)
- `DEBUG_MODE`: `False` for production
- `PYTHONUNBUFFERED`: `1`
- `PORT`: The port Uvicorn should listen on (e.g., `8000`)
