### 새로운 MCP 서버 추가

```python
new_endpoint = MCPEndpoint(
    name=""new_system"",
    url=""http://localhost:8085/mcp/new"",
    description=""새로운 의료 시스템""
)
mcp_manager.add_endpoint(new_endpoint)
```

