client.py,mr_academy/nvenv/Lib/site-packages/langsmith/client.py,b51e0dafeec7d0509b42a45ebeb1a0d30bac553c,dlytica-gcp/updated_dlytica_academy_chatbot,https://api.github.com/repositories/986297498/contents/mr_academy/nvenv/Lib/site-packages/langsmith/client.py?ref=95324c36fb3df940afdd52c26da21b0b4b7bc034,https://api.github.com/repositories/986297498/git/blobs/b51e0dafeec7d0509b42a45ebeb1a0d30bac553c,https://github.com/dlytica-gcp/updated_dlytica_academy_chatbot/blob/95324c36fb3df940afdd52c26da21b0b4b7bc034/mr_academy/nvenv/Lib/site-packages/langsmith/client.py,,,0,0,0,18,2025-07-25T05:33:58Z,0,0,"# Dlytica Academy Chatbot

An enterprise-grade AI-powered conversational assistant built using **FastAPI**, **LangChain**, **OpenAI GPT**, and **PostgreSQL**. This intelligent chatbot provides contextual responses, handles appointment bookings, and maintains conversation history using advanced Natural Language Processing and Machine Learning techniques.

The system features a modern floating chat interface with voice input capabilities, real-time session management, and is fully containerized for production deployment on Kubernetes.

---

## Table of Contents

- [Overview](#overview)
- [Architecture](#architecture)
- [Features](#features)
- [Technology Stack](#technology-stack)
- [Project Structure](#project-structure)
- [Getting Started](#getting-started)
- [Configuration](#configuration)
- [Docker Deployment](#docker-deployment)
- [Kubernetes Deployment](#kubernetes-deployment)
- [System Flow](#system-flow)
- [Security Features](#security-features)
- [Monitoring & Analytics](#monitoring--analytics)
- [Testing](#testing)
- [API Documentation](#api-documentation)
- [Troubleshooting](#troubleshooting)
- [Contributing](#contributing)

---

## Overview

The Dlytica Academy Chatbot is designed to:

- **Provide Intelligent Support**: Answer user queries using a knowledge base of FAQ documents
- **Manage Appointments**: Handle booking, cancellation, and modification of appointments
- **Maintain Context**: Preserve conversation history and user preferences across sessions
- **Scale Efficiently**: Support multiple concurrent users with session isolation
- **Ensure Security**: Implement robust authentication and data protection measures

### Key Capabilities

- **Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG)**: Combines pre-trained language models with custom knowledge bases
- **Multi-turn Conversations**: Maintains context across multiple interactions
- **Voice Integration**: Supports speech-to-text input for accessibility
- **Real-time Processing**: Provides immediate responses with typing indicators
- **Session Management**: Persistent user sessions with automatic cleanup

---

## Architecture

### System Architecture Diagram

```
┌─────────────────┐    ┌─────────────────┐    ┌─────────────────┐
│   Frontend      │    │   Backend       │    │   Database      │
│   (HTML/CSS/JS) │◄──►│   (FastAPI)     │◄──►│   (PostgreSQL)  │
└─────────────────┘    └─────────────────┘    └─────────────────┘
         │                       │                       │
         │                       │                       │
         ▼                       ▼                       ▼
┌─────────────────┐    ┌─────────────────┐    ┌─────────────────┐
│   Web Speech    │    │   LangChain     │    │   ChromaDB      │
│   API           │    │   + OpenAI      │    │   (Vectors)     │
└─────────────────┘    └─────────────────┘    └─────────────────┘
```

### Component Breakdown

1. **Frontend Layer**
   - Responsive web interface with floating chat widget
   - Voice input integration using Web Speech API
   - Real-time message handling with typing indicators

2. **Backend Layer**
   - FastAPI-based REST API with async processing
   - LangChain orchestration for LLM interactions
   - Session management with PostgreSQL persistence

3. **AI Layer**
   - OpenAI GPT-3.5-turbo for natural language generation
   - ChromaDB for vector-based document retrieval
   - Custom tools for date extraction and booking logic

4. **Data Layer**
   - PostgreSQL for structured data (sessions, users, bookings)
   - ChromaDB for unstructured data (document embeddings)
   - File storage for uploaded documents and assets

---

## Features

### Core Features

**Intelligent Conversation Management**
- Context-aware responses using conversation history
- Multi-turn conversation support
- Session persistence across browser sessions
- Automatic session cleanup and management

**Appointment Booking System**
- Intelligent information collection (name, email, phone, date, time)
- Input validation and sanitization
- Booking conflict detection
- Appointment modification and cancellation

**Document-Based Knowledge System**
- PDF document processing and indexing
- Semantic search using vector embeddings
- Contextual answer generation
- Real-time document updates

**Voice Integration**
- Speech-to-text input support
- Multi-language recognition
- Accessibility compliance
- Fallback to text input

**User Experience**
- Modern, responsive design
- Typing indicators and loading states
- Error handling and user feedback
- Mobile-first approach

### Advanced Features

**Security & Privacy**
- Input sanitization and XSS prevention
- Session-based authentication
- CORS configuration
- Data encryption in transit

**Analytics & Monitoring**
- Conversation logging and analysis
- User behavior tracking
- System performance monitoring
- Error tracking and alerting

**Performance & Scalability**
- Async request processing
- Database connection pooling
- Horizontal scaling support
- Resource optimization

---

## Technology Stack

### Backend Technologies

| Technology | Version | Purpose | Benefits |
|------------|---------|---------|----------|
| **FastAPI** | 0.104+ | Web Framework | High performance, automatic docs, type safety |
| **LangChain** | 0.1.0+ | LLM Orchestration | Agent management, memory, tool integration |
| **OpenAI** | 1.0+ | Language Model | Advanced NLP, conversation generation |
| **PostgreSQL** | 13+ | Database | ACID compliance, advanced queries |
| **ChromaDB** | 0.4+ | Vector Database | Semantic search, embedding storage |
| **Pydantic** | 2.0+ | Data Validation | Type safety, automatic validation |
| **Tenacity** | 8.0+ | Retry Logic | Resilience, error handling |

### Frontend Technologies

| Technology | Purpose | Benefits |
|------------|---------|----------|
