### Key Components Explained

#### **app.py** - Main Application
- FastAPI application initialization
- CORS middleware configuration
- API endpoint definitions
- Session management logic
- Health check endpoints

#### **chatbot/** - Core Logic
- **agent.py**: LangChain agent setup, tool integration
- **database.py**: PostgreSQL connection pooling, query methods
- **document_loader.py**: PDF processing, text extraction
- **rag_system.py**: Vector store creation, similarity search
- **user_info.py**: User data collection, validation logic

#### **static/** - Frontend Assets
- **home.html**: Single-page chat interface
- **style.css**: Responsive design, animations
- **script.js**: WebSocket communication, voice input

#### **kube-vm/** - Deployment Configuration
- Production-ready Kubernetes manifests
- Service discovery and load balancing
- Ingress configuration for external access
- Database deployment and persistence

