http://localhost:5002
```

### Intelligent Q&A System
```http
POST /api/ask
```

Advanced conversational interface supporting both general inquiries and camp-specific data queries.

**Request Parameters:**
```json
{
  ""question"": ""string (required) - User query in natural language"",
  ""user_id"": ""string (optional) - User identifier for personalization"", 
  ""camp_id"": ""string (optional) - Required for camp-specific data queries"",
  ""conversation_id"": ""string (optional) - Maintains conversation context""
}
```

**Response Format:**
```json
{
  ""answer"": ""string - AI-generated response"",
  ""timestamp"": ""string - Response timestamp"",
  ""conversation_id"": ""string - Conversation identifier"",
  ""trace_id"": ""string - Request tracking ID""
}
```

