### Expedition Summary

A summary of the expedition is saved to a text file.

```text
🏛️ AMAZON ARCHAEOLOGICAL EXPEDITION SUMMARY
══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

📊 ANALYSIS STATISTICS:
