### Backup Strategy
```bash
# Backup ChromaDB data
tar -czf backup_$(date +%Y%m%d_%H%M%S).tar.gz cache/chroma_db/

# Backup configuration
cp .env backup_env_$(date +%Y%m%d_%H%M%S)

