### Project Structure

```
DIA3/
├── src/
│   ├── agents/           # AI agent implementations
│   │   ├── knowledge_graph_agent.py  # Knowledge Graph Agent
│   │   ├── enhanced_knowledge_graph_agent.py  # Enhanced Knowledge Graph Agent
